PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"## 调度结论\n\n**效率 0.90 时，两辆车可按原时刻表出车，但必须先执行 20 kW 楼宇负荷平移。** 如果“原计划”不包括这项调整，则不能直接发车：低温未平移时，A 车 01:00 只能到 **117 kWh**，低于要求的 **126 kWh，缺 9 kWh**。\n\n### 最小调整量\n\n将 **20 kW** 可延楼宇负荷从 **00:30–01:00** 移到 **01:30–02:00**，对应转移电量 10 kWh，总楼宇用电不削减。\n\n### 半小时充电表\n\n| 时段 | 平移后楼宇 kW | A 充电 kW | B 充电 kW | 接入合计 kW |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 00:00–00:30 | 40 | 80 | 0 | 120 |\n| 00:30–01:00 | 80 | 40 | 0 | 120 |\n| 01:00–01:30 | 50 | 0 | 70 | 120 |\n| 01:30–02:00 | 70 | 0 | 50 | 120 |\n\n结果：A `72 + (80+40)×0.5×0.90 = 126 kWh`；B `76 + (70+50)×0.5×0.90 = 130 kWh`。两车均刚好达标，**没有冗余**。\n\n## 效率失效边界\n\n低温四格可用充电 AC 电量合计为 120 kWh，两车合计需补 108 kWh 电池电量：\n\n`108 / η ≤ 120  ⇒  η ≥ 0.90`\n\n- **η = 0.90**：仅 20 kW 平移可行，且零冗余。\n- **η < 0.90**：无论怎么平移，两车都无法同时满足，这招失效。\n- **η = 0.85**：总需 127.06 kWh AC，但只有 120 kWh，总缺 7.06 kWh AC（6 kWh 电池）；即使取最均衡的 20 kW 平移，A、B 也各缺 3 kWh。正常场景下 A 车同样已缺 3 kWh，因此不能按原计划发车。\n\n## 交付物\n\n- `model.mjs`：导出 `plan(night, efficiency)`，含正常、低温、平移场景以及最小平移量求解。\n- `HANDOVER.md`：一页交接稿。\n- `model.test.mjs`：覆盖 90%、85%、临界效率和物理约束。\n- 验证：`node --test`，**5 项全部通过**。\n- Git 提交：`20a84d3`。\n\n交接前需确认：A 车 00:00 准时插枪、01:00 前实际达到 126 kWh；20 kW 负荷转移已执行；当夜实测综合效率不低于 0.90。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:todo_write","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:palimpsest_work","tool/result"]}
